Heading: QUALITATIVE FACTORS

Section text:
We believe the following business strengths allow us to successfully compete in the industry:
1. Diversified revenue from clients at multiple locations and geographies in India;
2. Access to Strategic Advertising Rights Across Multiple Media Assets;
3. Experience of our Promoters and senior management team;
4. Focus on Customer Satisfaction and Execution Capabilities;
5. Strong Client Retention and Repeat Business
For a detailed discussion on the qualitative factors which form the basis for computing the price, please refer to sections titled
“Our Business” beginning on page 105 of this Red Herring Prospectus.

